short_description = "A very alternative twenty-something year old with very fond memories of the Strawberry Pie."
long_description = "A rather contrasting enby twenty-something with a fondness for retro consoles. One fateful day after a draining day of pretending to be mentally present at work, they came home for a cozy night of gaming, only to wake up in the game’s tutorial, right where they had happened to fall asleep in the real world."
